        "payload": "tree 581789b3290810e50d40fb64bd7bdf89a7b4d6cb\nparent 5af43a995aa054aa2dc46ab6b69d39dc837fda05\nauthor Alex Gleason <alex@alexgleason.me> 1780187513 +0200\ncommitter Alex Gleason <alex@alexgleason.me> 1780187513 +0200\n\nfix(nostrify): start NPool eoseTimeout only after an event and EOSE\n\nPreviously the timer started as soon as any relay sent EOSE, which\ncould prematurely cancel relays that have results when an empty relay\nresponded first. Now the countdown only begins once at least one event\nhas been received and a relay has sent EOSE.\n",
